{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7cb7155599cdcf5bbf96faf6aaf197a4fb8a8e58041424c5334b36804e7ea460",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78ad83f2e90b50e6215305c70e71d7b3c30288178d431e1c822ef18ef4138e3",
      "text": "最想吃的蛋糕是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5eb4f58e16e9251fb48916f07d01615fb90f5978dea986b8b2eff6e0f2313b47",
      "text": "离自己的生日还有一个月的某天，\n卷绪向制作人倾诉自己在为和家人一起吃的\n生日蛋糕而烦恼。\n虽然家人跟他说挑卷绪自己最想吃的蛋糕就行，\n但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000023:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000023:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e78ad83f2e90b50e6215305c70e71d7b3c30288178d431e1c822ef18ef4138e3",
      "text": "最想吃的蛋糕是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7121b25524e3d33282d08bfca19b5d78f4198c6c45fe0be7a688b55e4992cd0",
      "text": "卷绪呱呱坠地之日仅余一月便将临近，\n事态却依旧陷入混沌之中么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d781f6bbd90ee048c68705b2299599787c736597c25d7fa43673d5f458388d98",
      "text": "果然还是再去问问本人吧！\n如果有什么烦恼，我也想帮上忙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3adf17a059960cac928e7833506e1d3ef962ad26171aae67e2def933ec3fa472",
      "text": "然其绝口不提，\n恐亦有其相应之缘由……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b89dba173e5e8ecfa38a8054aa7b38a40f187cc99c745a579252e752d366c478",
      "text": "辛苦了。大家一脸凝重的表情，\n这是怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe8ce337aea45bda245bc7b1c919bb3195b9e5d25189fde2f1ff4deead11904a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n现在正在为卷绪的事开个小会呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:897db611a4da36227026919dc12737f66b9316d00f736e0e7d083c2766c59e6a",
      "text": "卷卷好像有什么烦恼的样子。\n最近经常叹气，让人好担心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a15d486e92edaf362218d56eda32dca7847f86cfb0bc104281f8bc1717c8ff3a",
      "text": "我试着旁敲侧击地问过，\n但他只说是为蛋糕的事在烦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:536edb558912946fa31c4ab323a039b97d4db12520caab9ff81ae0b4dd57c2b4",
      "text": "除此之外的事情，最终还是\n什么都没有对我们说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f63b7593b32ec948f9225ddf9bd619e2e2d004f171fc16646ecc51bb0fc9475",
      "text": "制作人有没有从卷绪那里\n听说过什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_a:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c718df3eab2570ca110ce2c130f685532961bb8228684a5dd32f5afa2b10d08d",
      "text": "其实，关于这件事，我正好有事想和大家\n商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3446b6d68a17c8104fce27a7fb01d0074b9a7eddb9f6f5fa91bf738f4da5c54",
      "text": "数小时前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab40dac8abd393b8323a5b68ba35f4d144dc36ca24ee7a317c96bbb7bf264f50",
      "text": "嗯……这家店的蛋糕，\n味道和外观都很华丽，挺好的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba7cb80497ca7dcf0e78cb7f98b262efe0f51bdd3789ad6fd342cdea60cb010f",
      "text": "这里的蛋糕也非常好吃呢……\n但是……果然还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d404e934f755bf057cef1f4b9efcb29bf4c1c45b0715cee7fd552c67b7bbb0",
      "text": "（卷绪先生怎么了呢？平时看剪报本的时候明明更开心的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8566913b4407e0aae63c9ca528728131dbca0c2743398a6166da077dbe46cda",
      "text": "辛苦了。看您似乎很烦恼的样子，\n是在挑下个休息日要吃的蛋糕吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3971b1fb54ee844774ca32d2723b3659346a3ca585f66394a4a0967a0d7d44",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー。辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43c4ded3c2f84b710fa18fd14d329216c59b0ffe9e30a19c571fbc75b5f54cd9",
      "text": "其实我正在挑生日时\n和家里人一起吃的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa99d9d65a870c2217bad57e619a2a3aaa025e8d0d4b7da0eb72813778448ba",
      "text": "家里人说，只要是我最想吃的蛋糕，\n他们也都想尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7432b376be8ad989a3164f72fd103566cf883729aae42aa18c427c9f23a07cd8",
      "text": "自己喜欢的东西，能被别人想要一起\n分享享用，这真的很令人开心对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1e1c9a4c2efb18666f29a1b8daeb80f57636ab73963f6b3d8f611c4d32b0e6c",
      "text": "……可是，这样反而有点让人为难了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5caa968d2a0640fd987c951124c745fc4919ac4a1ebfd681d8e22007979f392c",
      "text": "令人为难……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:833b0eb88f3130f2d9299714c7e0bff73678238c9a1c686f88fe5a77779c39ee",
      "text": "我最想吃的蛋糕……\n其实是庄一郎先生做的蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d551c4717818082991fe3adec7340f7aee07301e7f8a1e6ae05944eb27b8ae",
      "text": "一说到“最想吃”我立刻就浮现出来了，\n也是想让家里人尝尝的特别蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aed5640b1a42185fb2bfef6c03d7f85e7adde3254ea950d452c9d070733ace4",
      "text": "可是生日那天，我想Cafe Parade的大家\n也会为我准备大家一起吃的蛋糕吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:688c0dd1b61098a02ae8c36de5e770d7c1012479ce4e9286f528139fa53145fa",
      "text": "既然如此，还要拜托他做给家里人吃的蛋糕，\n总觉得有点过意不去……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2826637ac7fbb56f4562207daaf9e2d6e8c908d90a23bdc237abd5964cd01b4",
      "text": "可要说从其他蛋糕里挑一个最想要的，\n那也相当难办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba28192d0007d18075e933f4d0dab4c111cbc2c60401953d9738e55a0e578da0",
      "text": "原来如此……那么，不如由我来替您\n准备推荐的蛋糕如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac976189ddd93a94ec45ac4f6e4c533b279316b4b2ea733fec735eb2fff7418c",
      "text": "哎……！？可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6116717c43507bc10ab725946ad41752d534387a3e33f7464a54df66fe79610e",
      "text": "毕竟至今为止我和卷绪先生在工作结束后吃过了很多蛋糕，\n这方面的知识我还是有的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:661e2ace2048a958534b2d007009aa4d40e92926c658b3564739b807c4869807",
      "text": "我很想尝尝制作人推荐的蛋糕……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b3ffeace715cd5f78211a2b7c9e853d7421a32d93b1365455733567f1c87b98",
      "text": "那我就恭敬不如从命，\n拜托您帮忙预订了可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63555bc60a46f5132377f0ca2276965467441fd624f12006836da40b8ff1f44e",
      "text": "好的！请好好期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bddfa2a142276eb36d3a1e7138d9c47bd162da90f58f3b854ee67c8c498d44d2",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279567ab97daf56881a5d728e01792cf982595a69cd0251e6fd6f03974237c94",
      "text": "今天非常感谢大家！\n蛋糕和料理都非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a97aa4b012352af7efc3c01b487446c7aa2ad2def68f5b63065f87cd871b6f4",
      "text": "你能高兴，我们也很开心。\n办了一场很棒的派对呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4dcb77ec4797717b515e56ef19e7e65b020cd15a07168bc33074c89e3607259",
      "text": "为精炼出配得上今宵之宴的供物，\n吾解放禁断之魔术亦算未曾虚掷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0a65f698f9bd8297416b7fae271621bb6c52557c82e74e13f153c91d86f00e6",
      "text": "是的，多亏了大家，明明来之前特意空着肚子，\n结果吃得太饱甚至有点撑了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bedd45fbe444fc0a1d909961ec09bc5711d626e582ea9a3678771b70133a96e",
      "text": "嗯嗯。每一样都好好吃，\n我也一不小心吃太多啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0232cabe7a79e291d7dc43f2e5fad80e803837e61e3591a1c45a5ecf27033012",
      "text": "卷绪先生。在回去之前，我把约好的蛋糕\n交托给您吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89598d5699433dcb5ea20348fab232cd4caf29fae2496c76ea794475e0dc0c7f",
      "text": "非常感谢……！\n好期待会是什么样的蛋糕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f6ad0ee08863f96dab277c690bfddf54bafbc38fae67dbbbfe1620ef2bde131",
      "text": "好的。\n这是您拜托我准备的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000145:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51b88f032e6a0b755a1e7db2b4257001fddf66d00f712ff6e0e22d637867821c",
      "text": "为您准备了珍藏的蛋糕。请拿好",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000146:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a741ac2b6981bd257e02d8f5a829fce2fb43679524295c3055d0ca7d9b86e2a9",
      "text": "这个，请务必和家里人一起享用",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_d:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72c12fa70896820885533ec647853b2df19e2aebb619531f0c82f53549673098",
      "text": "哎……这难道是……庄一郎先生的蛋糕！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f01864cc89cc789e8c29a1c168c332cc1541cce0ba789cd383cba82dc4f46de4",
      "text": "明明都已经有派对用的蛋糕了，\n还另外特意准备了吗……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea9e694640a5a183d49ae501767afb66de187aa1f46cf3a4836dfcca973eef3",
      "text": "是的。听制作人说明了原委后，\n我一口就答应下来了。这可是我的自信之作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fab2e9d5a4e85263bc0f92a35454b56a4c5fbbfe1382703c4bf8555eed3f005f",
      "text": "还有这个，是我送的礼物！\n卷卷，生日快乐～☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ef802bc39cd8a0f59f212af4ee036af66a7e80db203e45a3dcadc162f485702",
      "text": "祝贺汝之生诞，吾亦将\n倾注了强绝魔力的供物奉上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58f4497ff76e3875efe5b49cdfe4fc441eb4f9f8e4677ba756eaad90d0d3a46e",
      "text": "给，这是我送的。\n再次祝你生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2dada03e8e8648bf3e5e3b31f7652f31f63b8ab8a6b28ad8926424fb5f4ce4cb",
      "text": "还有，这是我送的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae4f6c6cf2b1bf2bfa961126d6e582d59303fb55b79aae1302a828c890e74ba9",
      "text": "哇哇，这么多……！？\n超级开心！这些全都是甜点吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:507d34ef7f76ec9e14d58aa372cdf1ef54d12d525433a04fe8c6581694f20ac2",
      "text": "除了东云给的蛋糕以外，都是能放挺久的蛋糕和\n烘焙点心，你就慢慢品尝吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eadc47f0113950ea9fe9909f222d1202c0bcaca802080a1889b5d60808615c11",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，我们的惊喜礼物，\n大成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f5328a7229c229dff57d8064cc3474f2f8ecba64a0adfee903a94a6e229cf8",
      "text": "供物堆叠已至几近满溢出怀抱之境地。\n至汝之居城前，便由吾助汝一臂之力吧，卷绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fc7800d62af16ae8af3f4383ad95809ff4b0b8030c35bd31085e041ce3ece6",
      "text": "就这样大家一起送卷卷回家吧！\n那样也比较热闹好玩对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_02_1_2_030_02:1_2_030_02_e:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f43742dbf909a47004b21d627de662e9be117286fe2de58692b650328531ce3",
      "text": "可以吗？感觉像派对的延长一样好开心♪\n大家，今天真的太感谢你们了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
